            "review_title": "Review at Ramen Danbo",
            "review_text": "Leonhkny\nHong Kong, China29703 contributions\n0\nSurprisingly delight\nDec 2022\nDecided to give ramen a try while exploring Ho Chi Minh City's Japantown. Originally from Fukuoka, Ramen Danbo serves authentic tonkotsu ramen. Menu is simple and largely self-served. Noodle is slightly on the soft side but broth is tasty and not salty. Service is pretty kind. I guess price should be high by local standard but still very modest for us. The area around is quite interesting to wander.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 3, 2022",
