            "review_title": "Review at Ramen Danbo",
            "review_text": "Jeongsoo H\nSeoul, South Korea5 contributions\n0\nGood Ramen\nJul 2019\nWe tried Chanpon noodle (stir fried seafood and vegetable mixed soup), limited offer for 30 servings per day. Lots of stir fried cabbages, beansprouts and some baby clams, those added complexity to the long time cooked thick and milky pork bone soup,,, very tasty!! But regret, somebody forgot to serve chopped greed onion which we ordered for extra. (This is important topping adding fresh green soothness to rather thick and rich soup). We recommend to order Gyoza (grilled pot sticker) and small bowl of rice,,, typical combination how men in Japan usually order. (For ladies, it might be too much.)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 13, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
