            "review_title": "Review at Ramen Danbo",
            "review_text": "Lulu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam92 contributions\n1\nBest Ramen in town\nAug 2018 • Couples\nFor us, Asian, this place serves the best ramen. You don't come here expecting a Pho bowl with lots of meat and condiments. This is a ramen place and though it's tucked away, it's a lovely gem. \n\nWe had been eating at this ramen chain back in Australia. We were really happy to find it again in Saigon. The soup is the soul of ramen and this place totally nails it every time. We often order egg ramen with some extra ramen on the side along with a plate of Japanese-styled fried chicken. It was the best combination for a full meal for two. Definitely worth a visit and a lot of comebacks.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 28, 2018",
