            "review_text": "Dannie N\nLos Angeles, California3 contributions\n1\nRidiculous rule: not allowed to bring food leftover home\nMar 2018 • Friends\nThe WORST service and WASTEFUL restaurant ever!!!! They served me a gigantic bowl of noodle. They never warned me about the size of the order. When I couldn’t finish it, the restaurant prohibited me from bringing my leftover home. They would rather throw away the food that I have paid for than allow me to doggy bag it home and enjoy the food the next day. \n\nThe only explanation I got was that it was the rule for two years. The owner doesn’t speak English so there is nothing I can do about it!\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2018",
