            "review_text": "PatriciaMacleod\nAberdeen, United Kingdom25 contributions\n0\nGreat ramen\nJan 2018\nHad lunch here. Easy to choose your dish from pictures on menu. Mark your choices on pre-printed sheet. Select how soft or firm you want your noodles etc. Meal was delicious. Quirky twist is the Japanese house style where all the staff shout “welcome” in Japanese when any customers arrive and shout “thank you” when they leave. For these moments you feel you’re celebrating something with them. If you like ramen you’ll love Danbo.\nRead more\nWritten January 19, 2018",
